+ * The sidebar folds away and the panel fills the window on the plan's first
+ * agent, Claude Opus 5.5 at high effort, started fourteen minutes before
+ * launch. Its transcript reads the memberships code, writes the migration
+ * and the invite route, runs `pnpm test src/members`, and opens #214; then
+ * the developer's message steers it (links last 14 days, any admin may
+ * withdraw) and it is acting on that, the members tests running again, so
+ * the tab ends on "Working…" with Stop in the box. A second agent,
+ * "Invite emails" on GPT-6.1 Sol, stands as the tab beside it. Every tool
+ * here is one this release names a row for (bash, read_file, grep,
+ * apply_patch); every model id is one the catalog lists.
+ */
